      "id": "word-frío--proximity-game",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "frío",
      "answerEn": "cold; far from the target in a hot-and-cold game",
      "noteEn": "In the guessing game, temperature words describe distance rather than actual heat. Frío tells the searcher that they are far from the hidden object or chosen place.",
      "example": {
        "es": "¡Frío! Busca en otra habitación.",
        "en": "Cold! Look in another room."
      },
